{title: Zindagi Kaisi Hai Paheli}
{artist: Manna Dey Salil Chowdhury}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Zindagi, kaisi [G]hai paheli, haaye
[F]Kabhi to hansaaye, [C]kabhi ye rulaye
[F]Kabhi dekho maan nahi jaage,
[G]Pechhay pechhay [C]sapnon ke bhage
[F]Kabhi dekho maan nahi jaage,
[G]Pechhay pechhay [C]sapnon ke bhage;
[F]Ek din [G]sapno ka raahi,
[G]Chala jaaye [F]sapno ke [C]aage kaahan
[F]Jinhone sajaaye yaha mele,
[G]Sukh dukh [C]sang sang jheley
[F]Jinhone sajaaye yaha mele,
[G]Sukh dukh [C]sang sang jheley;
[F]Wahi [G]chunkar [G]khaamoshi,
[G]Yoon [F]chaley jaaye [C]akele kahan
